  "selected_root": "Positive root disjunctions such as x in {0,1,30,871} did not qualify finite linear search. Original89 has203 integer variables and zero recognized bounded variables before the repair; its prior profile performed21113 theory-pipeline calls. Earlier interval-hull augmentation alone still timed out.",
  "implementation": [
    "Collect exact unions of affine univariate equality points only at positive root conjuncts; flatten nested unions, intersect repeated domains, reject guarded/mixed-variable/fractional alternatives and retain original formulas.",
